menuconfig UHC_PIO_USB
	bool "Pico-PIO-USB host controller"
	depends on SOC_RP2040 && UHC_DRIVER
	help
	  Enable the Zephyr UHC driver that wraps sekigon-gonnoc/Pico-PIO-USB
	  in host mode. Owns PIO0 and consumes a D+/D- GPIO pair via the
	  raspberrypi,pio-usb-host devicetree binding.

menuconfig UDC_PIO_USB
	bool "Pico-PIO-USB device controller"
	depends on SOC_RP2040 && UDC_DRIVER
	help
	  Enable the Zephyr UDC driver that wraps sekigon-gonnoc/Pico-PIO-USB
	  in device mode. Owns PIO0 and consumes a D+/D- GPIO pair via the
	  raspberrypi,pio-usb-device devicetree binding. Mutually exclusive
	  with UHC_PIO_USB at build time (one PIO instance, one program).
